# Auto push

After completing implementation work in this repo:

1. Commit relevant changes with a short message (why, not just what).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch immediately — do not wait for the user to ask.
3. Never force-push to `main`/`master`.
4. Never commit secrets (`.env`, `*.jks`, `key.properties`, credentials).
5. If push fails (auth/network), say so clearly and stop.
